      "en": "He will consume the glory of his forest and of his fruitful field, both soul and body. It will be as when a standard bearer faints.",
      "ko": "그 삼림과 기름진 밭의 영광이 전부 소멸되리니 병인이 점점 쇠약하여 감 같을 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "480dbad52e39c3baf86afd64a5c66a488065f506557e46a83db7ae45ff7018f0",
      "translation_text_hash": "410e3f76abfe45d07bc3393643b92ba6ac4a75ecfd9a10057bfe1d7da4fa0e9c",
