      "en": "For though your people, Israel, are like the sand of the sea, only a remnant of them will return. A destruction is determined, overflowing with righteousness.",
      "ko": "이스라엘이여 네 백성이 바다의 모래 같을찌라도 남은 자만 돌아오리니 넘치는 공의로 훼멸이 작정되었음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "2ff329894f5119fb98d4bc3040fa68ee7392b4b57bb51b871f6ce2215d20b108",
      "translation_text_hash": "5c548bb7f4bbf7fea51574f930c705ee971c32b1b6e8e01cf16754c0ec90b3fa",
