      "en": "For yet a very little while, and the indignation against you will be accomplished, and my anger will be directed to his destruction.”",
      "ko": "내가 불구에 네게는 분을 그치고 노를 옮겨 그들을 멸하리라 하시도다",
      "source_text_hash": "04d8279d012169b63e84ce87183c5d3346a22fcab5d0313789e513d3cf9047f3",
      "translation_text_hash": "ca9282bdaf64aa51d5d75865e7e0b37791acdeadaa530f9f4f3441a301eb59b8",
